    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Guardians' rotation shopping continues. They've agreed to a three-year, $48 million deal with Foster Griffin, MLB.com's Mark Feinsand reports.",
      "likes": 44,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 5,
      "at": "2026-11-25T23:32:48.712Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36czeyde22o",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I’m curious if this much investment means Bibee is traded.",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "sleepingmonkey.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Me likey! Now sign a few bats",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "beerfartz.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I rather see Ben Lively in the rotation more than Foster Griffin",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "desarch.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Much better",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "deathtongue24.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ガーディアンズの先発補強が続く。MLB.comのマーク・ファインサンド記者によると、フォスター・グリフィンと3年4800万ドルで合意した。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "The Orioles and Luis Robert Jr. have agreed on a deal, source says, that brings the outfielder back to Baltimore. It’s one year for $12 million, source said. @JonHeyman first on terms. @FrancysRomero first said the Orioles are closing in on this.",
      "likes": 34,
      "reposts": 6,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-26T00:25:21.218Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36fxdhcfk2o",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Source with knowledge said Luis Robert Jr. had other offers. He wanted Baltimore as his destination",
          "likes": 14,
          "author": "afkostka.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nice job giving credit where due. Very professional. Happy Thanksgiving Andy.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "rayglennon.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "オリオールズとルイス・ロバート・ジュニアが合意。外野手がボルチモアに戻る。1年1200万ドルとのこと。条件は@JonHeymanが最初に報じ、@FrancysRomeroがオリオールズが詰めの段階と先に伝えていた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Orioles outfielders in 2026 combined to produce a .225 average and .674 on-base-plus-slugging percentage, both of which were third worst in baseball. They need a lift. Luis Robert Jr. may not be the final one",
      "likes": 31,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-26T01:01:46.082Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36hyh3wqk2h",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Arozarena when?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "rabitaluna.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "They need a lift out of town I’ll be happy to drive them.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "neartheelevators.com"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "2026年のオリオールズ外野手陣は合計で打率.225、OPS.674。どちらもMLBで下から3番目だった。てこ入れが必要で、ルイス・ロバート・ジュニアが最後の補強とは限らない。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins are signing reliever Kevin Ginkel to a two-year contract, a source tells the Star Tribune. He had a 4.12 ERA in 74 games for the Diamondbacks last season with 72 strikeouts in 67.2 innings.",
      "likes": 27,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-26T03:24:31.220Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36pxph6ds22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズがリリーフのケビン・ギンケルと2年契約を結ぶ。スター・トリビューン紙に情報筋が明かした。昨季はダイヤモンドバックスで74試合に登板し、防御率4.12、67.2回で72奪三振。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Guardians have made Kris Bubic's deal official.",
      "likes": 23,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-25T18:49:54.019Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3n35t7inrqk2y",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ガーディアンズがクリス・ブービックとの契約を正式に発表した。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "nightengalejr.bsky.social",
      "author": "Bobby Nightengale",
      "team": "ツインズ",
      "outlet": "Star Tribune",
      "text": "The Twins were hunting another reliever with strong swing-and-miss stuff. Kevin Ginkel (26.2% K rate this year) joins Jeff Hoffman, Yoendrys Gómez and Andrew Morris in the back of their bullpen. More on their latest addition: www.startribune.com/kevin-ginkel...",
      "likes": 18,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-26T03:54:37.287Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:gtt6sqfv2lck4wxdxymmhrxk/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36rnjtxnk22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ツインズは空振りを奪える力のあるリリーフをもう1人探していた。ケビン・ギンケル(今季の奪三振率26.2%)が、ジェフ・ホフマン、ヨエンドリス・ゴメス、アンドリュー・モリスらと終盤を担う。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Kevin Gausman has pitched 175+ innings in 8 of last 10 non-pandemic seasons, and fell 1 out shy in another. He has 7 quality starts in 7 career outings in Detroit. He turns 36 in January. Tigers are banking on him providing innings + veteran presence for a young group. www.mlb.com/news/kevin-g...",
      "likes": 15,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-26T04:34:37.699Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3n36tv32swc24",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ケビン・ガウスマンは、パンデミックの年を除く直近10シーズンのうち8シーズンで175イニング以上を投げ、もう1シーズンもあと1アウトに迫った。デトロイトでは通算7登板で7度のクオリティスタート。1月に36歳になる。タイガースは若い投手陣にイニングと経験をもたらしてくれることを期待している。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
